' 实验2 类图 —— 同一套设计模式，两种语言（Python 后端 / C++ 实时语音核）
' 渲染：plantuml 实验2_类图.puml  或  https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml
' 本文件仅为设计制品，不代表已实现代码。
'
' baseline 原则：现有浏览器产品功能不改。下列抽象是叠加在 baseline 之上的
' 加速层(C++/WASM/实时) + 可降级可选能力；旧批处理流程 = fallback。

@startuml 实验2_Python侧_AIProvider
title 实验2 · Python 侧（apps/ai）：Strategy + Adapter + 责任链 + Template Method

interface AIProvider <<Strategy>> {
  +run(task) : ProviderRunResult
}

abstract class AiTaskTemplate <<Template Method>> {
  +run(task) : ProviderRunResult
  #_build_prompt(task)
  #_parse_payload(raw, task)
  #_on_failure(...)
}

class HttpApiProvider <<Strategy>> {
  - client : HttpApiClient
  +run(task) : ProviderRunResult
}
class CodexProvider <<Strategy>> {
  - client : CodexCliClient
  +run(task) : ProviderRunResult
}
class WritingScoreProvider
class SpeakingReportProvider
class MockSuccessProvider <<Strategy>>
class FallbackProvider <<Chain tail>> {
  +run(task) : ProviderRunResult
}

class HttpApiClient <<Adaptee>> {
  +invoke(prompt, stream=True)
}
class CodexCliClient <<Adaptee>> {
  +invoke(prompt)
}

class ProviderChain <<Chain of Responsibility>> {
  - providers : List<AIProvider>
  +execute(task) : ProviderRunResult
}
class ProviderRoute {
  + task_type
  + adapter_key
  + effective_provider
  + fallback_reason
}
class ProviderRunResult {
  + outcome
  + payload
  + metadata
}

AIProvider <|.. AiTaskTemplate
AIProvider <|.. MockSuccessProvider
AIProvider <|.. FallbackProvider
AiTaskTemplate <|-- HttpApiProvider
AiTaskTemplate <|-- CodexProvider
HttpApiProvider <|-- WritingScoreProvider
SpeakingReportProvider --|> AiTaskTemplate
HttpApiProvider o--> HttpApiClient
CodexProvider o--> CodexCliClient
ProviderChain o--> "1..*" AIProvider
ProviderChain ..> ProviderRoute
AIProvider ..> ProviderRunResult

note bottom of FallbackProvider
  红线：fallback 路径结构上
  不可能产出 outcome=SUCCESS，
  杜绝"假装 AI 成功"
end note
@enduml


@startuml 实验2_Python侧_报告与ASR
title 实验2 · Python 侧：ReportPipeline(Template) + ASRProvider(Strategy)

abstract class ReportPipeline <<Template Method>> {
  +generate(ctx) : Report
  #_collect_material(ctx)
  #_run_ai(material) : ProviderRunResult
  #_assemble_report(ai_result, material)
  #_assemble_fallback(ai_result, material)
}
class SpeakingReportPipeline
class WritingReportPipeline
ReportPipeline <|-- SpeakingReportPipeline
ReportPipeline <|-- WritingReportPipeline

interface ASRProvider <<Strategy>> {
  +start(fmt)
  +push_audio(pcm)
  +on_result(cb)
  +finish()
}
class OpenSpeechAsrProvider
class WhisperLocalAsrProvider <<future>>
ASRProvider <|.. OpenSpeechAsrProvider
ASRProvider <|.. WhisperLocalAsrProvider
@enduml


@startuml 实验2_CPP侧_实时语音核
title 实验2 · C++ 侧（src/ + include/）：同一组模式，本实验仅接口/类图

interface AudioProcessor <<纯算法核>> {
  +detect_voice(frame) : VadResult
  +trim_silence(buf) : Buffer
  +normalize(buf) : Buffer
  +resample(buf, target_hz) : Buffer
  +quality_check(buf) : QualityReport
}
note right of AudioProcessor
  无 IO、无平台依赖。
  实验4 抽核；实验5 内部接开源库
  (WebRTC VAD / SpeexDSP / libsamplerate)；
  编译目标：WASM + native
end note

interface ASRProvider <<Strategy>> {
  +Start(fmt)
  +PushAudio(pcm, n)
  +OnResult(cb)
  +Finish()
}
class OpenSpeechAsrProvider
ASRProvider <|.. OpenSpeechAsrProvider

interface ProtocolAdapter <<Adapter>> {
  +EncodeAudioFrame(pcm, n) : bytes
  +EncodeTextQuery(text) : bytes
  +DecodeFrame(data, n) : ParsedResponse
}
class OpenSpeechProtocolAdapter
ProtocolAdapter <|.. OpenSpeechProtocolAdapter
note right of OpenSpeechProtocolAdapter
  复用现有 protocol.cpp(478)
  二进制帧编解码逻辑
end note

class RealtimeGateway <<Adapter / 常驻服务>> {
  - protocol : ProtocolAdapter
  - asr : ASRProvider
  +on_client_audio(frame)
  +stream_transcript_to_client()
}
RealtimeGateway o--> ProtocolAdapter
RealtimeGateway o--> ASRProvider
RealtimeGateway ..> AudioProcessor

class FallbackPipeline <<Chain of Responsibility>> {
  +handle(audio) : TranscriptResult
}
note bottom of FallbackPipeline
  实时 ASR 网关失败
  → 批处理"录完上传评分"兜底
end note
RealtimeGateway ..> FallbackPipeline

class Scorer <<现存·Strategy 实例>> {
  - backend : ScorerBackend
  +Score(transcript) : IELTSScore
}
enum ScorerBackend {
  kCodexExec
  kOpenAIAPI
  kClaude
  kHeuristic
}
Scorer o--> ScorerBackend
note bottom of Scorer
  既有代码即 Strategy：
  佐证"同一模式、两种语言"
end note
@enduml
